     * Creates an {@link LdapContext} that is authenticated over a STARTTLS connection.
     *
     * <p>The method performs the following steps:</p>
     * <ol>
     *   <li>Builds the environment map with the LDAP provider URL, factory class,
     *       authentication mechanism, principal and credentials.</li>
     *   <li>Creates an {@code InitialLdapContext} which immediately authenticates
